# Market Intelligence Report Classification

Analyze the following market intelligence report and classify it into ONE SINGLE category among these monitoring types:
- competitive
- strategic
- commercial
- technological
- regulatory
- reputational

Even if multiple categories seem relevant, you must make a firm decision and choose the primary category that best represents the central objective of the report.

