## Instructions
1. Analyze all the information in the report
2. Identify the needs, entities, and monitoring types with their relevance
3. Choose ONE SINGLE category as the primary classification
4. Base your choice on the monitoring type with the highest relevance and representing the central goal of the report

Replace TYPE_CHOSEN with one of the exact enumeration values (competitive, strategic, commercial, technological, regulatory, reputational), indicate a confidence level between 0 and 100, and provide a concise justification in 2-3 sentences.
